{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35440","headline":"三年冬大礼五首 三 · 曹唐","name":"三年冬大礼五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太一天坛降紫君，属车龙鹤夜成羣。\n春浮玉藻寒初落，露拂金茎曙欲分。\n三代乐回风入律，四溟歌驻水成文。\n千官不动旌旗下，日照南山万树云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}